VS Code extension that renders Shattered Archive game-server .jsonl logs as a plain ANSI-colorized transcript in a side-by-side webview — a lightweight sibling to dsl-color-preview (same scaffold: esbuild-bundled dist/extension.js, F5 dev host, vsce package) and to the full DslLogViewer web app (C:\Projects\DslLogViewer), minus its damage parsing and playback tooling. Only game:remote-server:raw records (the actual ANSI game text) are rendered; GMCP, player keystroke-input events, and server lifecycle lines are dropped. Raw payloads are concatenated across the whole file before ANSI parsing, since payload.data is not line-aligned (confirmed against the real log corpus). src/ansiToHtml.ts is a real ANSI SGR parser (not DSL {X markup) using the same color palette as dsl-color-preview/game-client's dsl-to-ansi.ts, with the same true-black-renders-as-gray treatment.
